!procedure $duplicate_dataset_dialog()
salt
{
    title Duplicate Dataset Dialog

    We detected another dataset with the name <File Name> already uploaded to the tool.
    The tool currently does not allow two datasets with the same name to be 
    uploaded. You can either:
    1. **Update the existing dataset**: This updates the current dataset in the
    tool with the new one. You won't lose any validations attached to the 
    existing dataset, they will be moved over.
    2. **Replace the existing dataset**: This will delete the old dataset and 
    any validations associated with it, replacing it with the new one.

    What do you want to do?

    [Update the Dataset]
    [Replace the Dataset]
}
!endprocedure

!procedure $replace_dataset_confirm_dialog()
salt
{
    title Replace Dataset Confirm Dialog

    Are you sure you want to replace the existing dataset? You will lose all 
    data associated with it, including any validations.

    [No - Do not replace]
    [Yes - Replace the dataset]
}
!endprocedure


